        "encoding_method": "other",
        "encoding_details": "Dynamic graph snapshots are converted into transition matrices Pt, averaged into M, then lifted into a unitary operator U = e^{iL} and transformed with the graph Fourier basis Phi to form FQ = Phi^T U Phi.",
        "objective_function": "Modularity maximization over communities using Q(FQ, C) = sum_{c in C} sum_{i,j in c} (FQ(i,j) - gamma * k_i k_j / (2m)).",
        "constraints_handling": "Modularity-based partitioning with resolution parameter gamma; refinement via QAOA-inspired search or simulated annealing.",
